2026-11-07T12:03:08.7102980Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7761850Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7801030Z [0m
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7801430Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7803110Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7803740Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7805010Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7805630Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7806100Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7806310Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7806860Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7807080Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7807590Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7808220Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7808660Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7808910Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7809470Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7809730Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7810220Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7810420Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7810790Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7810950Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7811010Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7811200Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7811480Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7811950Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7844700Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7845400Z I will:
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7845600Z 
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7845930Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7847650Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7848110Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7848480Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7848810Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7849160Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7849510Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7849860Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7892990Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7894020Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7946310Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T12:03:08.7946830Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
